type: software
title: "BronchoTools"
abstract: >-
  3D Slicer extension containing tools for image-guided bronchoscopy: streaming video into Slicer, estimating depth
  maps and point clouds from monoscopic bronchoscope images, and building physical phantoms of endoluminal
  structures such as the airways.
